(* The box of the calibration bounds the time to the arming, but not the
   operations within it: an operation may come within its delay, at the
   upper bound of its running time, so that a second measurement of the
   bias between the message and the arming is not excluded. The box of the
   reading of the unit, without delays, excludes every other operation. *)

(* Two control steps from the reading of the default implementation of the
   unit, a robot at rest, and a tilt of 3 degrees. *)
run step (step (3.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0))
